# Tool icons

Read `crates/atlas-shell/ICONS.md` before changing tool or palette glyphs.
That specification owns the design rules; do not duplicate them here.
Geometry belongs in `crates/atlas-shell/assets/tool-icons.json` and painting in
`atlas_shell::icons`. Apps map semantic commands to the shared icon IDs.
Keep the specimen generator consuming the shared catalog.
